il, a mixed audience and a Laptop reading distance. The sketch and its critique questions come at the gate.\n\n**Left out**\n- The damage-specific steps, such as a photo check or a clear-or-unclear decision, which no source states\n- CS lead approval above €200, which framing A skips\n- The customer sending the parcel back, which the source implies but doesn't state as a step\n\n**Assumed, and what would settle each**\n- Reader and outcome, settled by your correction\n- The general returns path standing in for the damaged-item path, settled by a damaged-item runbook\n- The two \"Channel not stated\" edges, settled by how Admin or the warehouse system passes a return on\n- Balanced detail, a mixed audience and a Laptop distance, settled by your correction\n\nIs this the right reading of the board?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4380,"cache_read_input_tokens":100126,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4380},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e9edfc41-3cdd-4d79-a221-47363272241d","uuid":"82194bec-4117-4a82-98bf-159c16afd231","timestamp":"2026-10-26T22:04:03.705Z","request_id":"req_011CgRc1uxSFRATAE1CxuUqC"}
